# Third-party ECP5 bitstreams (decoder interop corpus).  These are OTHER
# PEOPLE'S binaries, downloaded to test a decoder against real-world input.
# Downloading a publicly offered file to test interoperability is fine;
# redistributing it from this repo is not.  corpus/manifest.json IS committed
# and records URL + SHA-256 for every file, so the corpus is reproducible from
# the original sources without us mirroring anyone's build output.
# Rebuild with: python3.15t scripts/ecp5_corpus_fetch.py --candidates ...
corpus/ecp5/
# Our own Diamond builds — regenerable via scripts/ecp5_diamond_build.py.
corpus/diamond/
